  "id": "benzodiazepine-agonist",
  "term": "benzodiazepine agonist",
  "definition": "Benzodiazepine agonist treatment is a management approach for long-lasting benzodiazepine dependence in which prescribed benzodiazepines are used in a stabilizing way rather than only tapered toward stopping. In the packet, it is discussed as a possible option for people who have not responded to tapering and discontinuation, especially those also receiving opioid agonist treatment.",
